{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":31360,\"title\":\"Autumn's Concerto\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Ren Guang-xi, a cocky law student, seems to lead the perfect life. He's the sole successor to a huge and famous business and is a talented ice hockey player. But in reality, his lonely life lacks joy, laughter and motivation. That is until he meets Liang Mu-cheng, the new bento seller at his school canteen. A harmless bet brings the two together and Guang-xi slowly changes as Mu-cheng teaches him how to give and love. Tragedy strikes when Guang-xi suddenly has to go through a major brain surgery which causes him to lose his memory.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1IhIoeKJZIRlJRTSAcgrFxFaf3U.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rqE2UxkS6LlD4h32xUrlkxZqIr.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":17,\"year\":2009,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":21,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"TTV Main Channel\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TW\",\"name\":\"Taiwan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2010-02-28\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1326037,\"name\":\"Chen Wei-Ling\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Vxrm7eBRFrsUfy5tnuGAjISu6e.jpg\"},{\"id\":1241442,\"name\":\"Ady An\",\"character\":\"Liang Mu-cheng\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xmPVIj1Vtzltq0KNNWx0LvMlvdo.jpg\"},{\"id\":83633,\"name\":\"Vanness Wu\",\"character\":\"Ren Guang-xi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9dwsdvRcMnXzCO3Oj0zQNnBEZH4.jpg\"},{\"id\":1245709,\"name\":\"Hsu Wei-ning\",\"character\":\"He Yi-qian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a5MYcV1aM5OSbcqrVU7EuNORhm5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1251223,\"name\":\"Wu Kang-ren\",\"character\":\"Hua Tuo-ye\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tgO3Uce3kqSFz17GXdbaDRBxf62.jpg\"},{\"id\":2287265,\"name\":\"Xiao Xiao Bin\",\"character\":\"Liang Xiao