:0.2206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94707,\"title\":\"The Love by Hypnotic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7TdSKz8lepKCFTxn7D4C6b6s55.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.22038834951456313,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":244015,\"title\":\"Our Love Triangle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3uB0AM3v8BQRrTCywTjoHjN31jo.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21836734693877552,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":211564,\"title\":\"Sullivan's Crossing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nYRnuQNR13nEYaXkOZaY0qIWl2K.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2131868131868132,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":312534,\"title\":\"Burning Rose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rPFnWMqgPeexeAMabsswcOiniSk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21263157894736842,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94796,\"title\":\"Crash Landing on You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fgBNLPr6mC8pxuR79ENAJY4nBmj.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21125000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"After losing all memories of his past, a wealthy lawyer travels to a rural village where a woman he once loved now lives with her son.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zFgIXk92soxUi0k1ZtbdnR0kKBe.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2009-10-04\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"1st stop\",\"overview\":\"Liang Mu Cheng loses her chance to enter college when one of her delivery jobs goes horribly wrong, thanks to Ren Guang Xi, a notorious and wealthy playboy with little cares in the world.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/72JOX3Z7wEGYhl6eC46C76LUysJ.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-04\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"2nd stop\",\"overview\":\"Ren Guang Xi softens as he finds himself attracted to Liang Mu Cheng. Unfortunately, there are more than a few people out for revenge against him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cYKA61NXApasn6s5iq3BA9mskQI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-11\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"3rd stop\",\"overview\":\"Uncle Cai makes his move, forcing Ren Guang Xi to step forward and fight to protect Liang Mu Cheng and clear her name.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c8q77tlWYrTN3kGtVY8j1gmMxwv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-18\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"4th stop\",\"overview\":\"The truth hearing begins and it's a race against the clock to find the evidence to clear Liang Mu Cheng's name.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bJqZ4XbjnmvaljnXvPGS9eqrRx6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-10-25\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"5th stop\",\"overview\":\"Facing a grim prognosis, Ren Guang Xi is no longer certain about the future of his relationship with Liang Mu Cheng. His mother continues to search for a way to save him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/LDNntKvLtONFYSkxwoKXsVwN6s.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-01\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"6th stop\",\"overview\":\"Liang Mu Cheng and Ren Guang Xi spend one final day together before the big operation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1l7DF9RBoEHRnuNUPQ48K5m92l3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-08\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"7th stop\",\"overview\":\"Mu Cheng lives a quiet life by the countryside with Xiao Le, her sickly son. Guang Xi has moved on to become a successful lawyer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qeytGSRi41GgKhOHoW8HZsvhgRE.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-15\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"8th stop\",\"overview\":\"When the lawsuit against Hua Tien Village goes underway, Mu Cheng finds herself facing the one man she never expected to see again.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2RHZyDSyeI8rJebcaDpQfPV98U.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-22\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"9th stop\",\"overview\":\"Although conflicted about his loyalties, Guang Xi does his best to help the distressed residents of Hua Tien Village.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iCioLrdrMkhCfqDUE63blsmIHbl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-11-29\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"10th stop\",\"overview\":\"It's Parents Day at Xiao Le's kindergarten.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vyhXNMrNEcQMAKipzqGvuW3Gt75.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-06\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"11th stop\",\"overview\":\"Guang Xi has a change of heart and decides to help the village people with their case.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i8CUE7S84NB5khNTT1DMTpxkWMa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-13\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"12th stop\",\"overview\":\"Guang Xi can't shake off the feeling that he's met Mu Cheng before. Yi Qian comes to Hua Tien to pick Guang Xi up, and notices his close bond with Xiao Le.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2BPG9gDJjlVBOA7NSw4F2sIvKq1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-20\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"13th stop\",\"overview\":\"Guang Xi leaves the village temporarily to return to Taipei for his upcoming wedding but Xiao Le isn't happy to see him go.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xCaI5N33i6aLFacDnZN74DOW4MW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2009-12-27\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"14th stop\",\"overview\":\"Guang Xi stumbles across some photos from his past, which sets the floodgates open, leaving everyone with some very hard questions to face.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y5KvU99OQobW6JXHNTGnIQPIcPK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-03\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"15th stop\",\"overview\":\"Tuo Ye does his best to protect Mu Cheng, but Guang Xi still has the upper hand in the fight for Xiao Le's custody.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oiI9puMsmqD5QQdhC7kC65UoUYt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-10\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"16th stop\",\"overview\":\"Mu Cheng and Xiao Le settle into their new life in the city. Guang Xi, however, is in for a bumpy ride as he starts to come under fire when an old court case comes back to haunt him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/94SPBdnWCFcmmSCqof2n3Uuz9Qh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-17\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"17th stop\",\"overview\":\"Mu Cheng is accidentally attacked and ends up in the hospital. Guang Xi tries to rekindle his past romance with Mu Cheng.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lYHsbQ9AdlBHf19dgxGjCQSkfwo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-24\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"18th stop\",\"overview\":\"Mu Cheng is tested once again when Guang Xi unexpectedly takes on a case for a client from his past.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pCWtVZXjkwwxcVOMN2r75T96H6y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-01-31\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"19th stop\",\"overview\":\"Tuo Ye does the unthinkable in order to save Ci Xing. Meanwhile, Guang Xi and Mu Cheng continue to misunderstand one another.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ksW5judXGbro1NxqkpEWRuu22QN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-07\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"20th stop\",\"overview\":\"Tuo Ye's trial gets underway. Later, unexpected developments shock the court. Outside of the courtroom, a surprising revelation sets Guang Xi aback.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zuFH2OM87fXvaHPLnrqZrl06xoM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-21\",\"runtime\":90},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"21st stop\",\"overview\":\"In this surprising conclusion of Autumn's Concerto, Guang Xi and Mu Cheng are forced to resolve their issues when Xiao Le is kidnapped.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3MwDoG8mR2lVdxyCH0e0mc8kJUV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2010-02-28\",\"runtime\":90}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2009-10-04\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}